name: js_escape
kind: measured
shape: fraction
face: in
membrane: false
note: The DOM gauntlet's second headline metric — the fraction of the vehicle
  that fell out to host JavaScript rather than being expressible in Koru.
  Computed only by dom/closer/board.mjs computeJsEscape (host lines classified
  by host language; Stage-C |zig transform bodies count on neither side).
  Series: r1 66.7% (36/54), r2 46.2% (60/130), r3 34.1% (44/129). Emit on
  every board round, with the escaped/total line counts in the payload.
